      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "再怎麼說，這裡的名字就是\n英俊！……咖啡館啊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƫ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "518D600E9EBC8AAAFF0C901988E17684540D5B575C31662F000A82F14FCAFF0120262026549655619928554A300200100002011401AB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "雖然現在這時代已經不推英俊了，\n但我想要珍惜我們的店名。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƫ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "96D6713673FE5728901966424EE35DF27D934E0D63A882F14FCA4E86FF0C000A4F46621160F3898173CD60DC6211501176845E97540D300200100002011401AB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哎呀，我離題了呢。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n總之，為了要讓厲害密阿雷格雷派餅\n帥帥氣氣地被端到客人面前，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n我需要一隻英俊的寶可夢……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƫ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 520,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54CE5440FF0C621196E2984C4E865462300200100001BE01000A7E3D4E4BFF0C70BA4E8689818B9353B25BB35BC6963F96F7683C96F76D3E9905000A5E255E256C236C23573088AB7AEF52305BA24EBA9762524DFF0C00100001BE00000A6211970089814E0096BB82F14FCA76845BF653EF59222026202600100002011401AB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 65
    },
    {
